 My original question was basically, how to restrict the find command to a
single directory; specifically to find all files older than a certain date.
There are probably many ways to approach this, however the only solution that
worked for me was the one quoted by Paul A Sand :

Unix Power Tools_ from O'Reilly (sec 18.24) suggests something like:

