Hi all,=20

First of all, thanks for the many and varied suggestions and comments =
for determining where the problem with running blast was.  The key tip, =
given by at least two different people, was to check my limit/ulimit =
settings. As it turned out, the default setting for v5.0 tru64 for the =
stacksize was:
stacksize       10485760 kbytes
(from the limit command in the cshell)
Changing this to a lower value of 128 M solved the trouble.  Now, the =
question is why is the default setting for the stacksize so high, and =
why did too high a stack size cause trouble?=20


Carl Virtanen
Scienific Programmer, Chugai Research Institute
for Molecular Medicine, Inc.


