Not that I've done this before, but it should work.  Usually
when this does not work, it's a problem with the domain name
server.  Make sure that all three names (two nodes and alias)
have both normal (name to numer) and inverse (number to name)
DNS records.  Test all six of these from both cluster side and
client side.  Also make sure cluster can do both normal and
inverse translation for the client's name.

