Original question:

   Does anyone have a working linux console termcap entry for Tru64?
   When I tried copying the linux and klone+* entries from a RedHat box
   to termcap on my Tru64 machine, it didn't work right (complained that
   one of the klone entries was too long; doesn't work at all without
   them). 

The list was strangely silent on this one.  I guess it was too easy :-)

The simple answer is that the linux console is a vt220 emulation.
Defining it that way in termcap and making appropriate links to the
vt220 file for terminfo solved my problems.

